WEBVTT

00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:05.825
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.296 --> 00:00:10.096
Delivers this message

00:00:10.534 --> 00:00:19.101
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.244 --> 00:00:20.711
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.711 --> 00:00:28.819
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.819 --> 00:00:29.114
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.353 --> 00:00:36.623
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:40.990
But please don't look back

00:00:41.131 --> 00:00:45.158
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.369 --> 00:00:49.465
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:53.176
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.443 --> 00:00:57.345
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.748 --> 00:01:01.479
Delivers this message

00:01:01.919 --> 00:01:10.088
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:18.663
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.102 --> 00:01:28.773
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:36.653 --> 00:01:39.178
It's long been said that women
can transform themselves.

00:01:39.256 --> 00:01:40.814
Well, it's now been ten days...

00:01:40.891 --> 00:01:43.325
...since Shurei started working
in the Outer Court...

00:01:43.393 --> 00:01:47.762
...disguised as a young man doing odd
jobs for the Senior Secretary of Finance.

00:01:52.202 --> 00:01:53.794
Hello, I'm back!

00:01:55.305 --> 00:01:58.741
Thank you, Shu.
It must've been hot outside.

00:01:59.142 --> 00:02:00.905
This extreme heat doesn't
bother me.

00:02:00.978 --> 00:02:02.036
Shu Hong.

00:02:02.112 --> 00:02:03.136
Yes!

00:02:05.082 --> 00:02:06.413
What can I do for you?

00:02:07.417 --> 00:02:10.477
Put these letters in order by date
and take them to the archives.

00:02:10.554 --> 00:02:12.579
You can tidy those shelves.

00:02:12.823 --> 00:02:15.189
Throw away all the papers
stacked over there.

00:02:15.259 --> 00:02:17.727
Go to the archives
and borrow the books listed here...

00:02:17.794 --> 00:02:19.091
...and return these five.

00:02:19.162 --> 00:02:21.528
On the way,
drop this off at the temple.

00:02:21.598 --> 00:02:23.567
While you're there, tell the director,
"What's the big idea...

00:02:23.567 --> 00:02:26.837
...submitting this garbage estimate.
Have your brains rotted away, you idiot?"

00:02:26.837 --> 00:02:29.169
Exactly as I said.
Don't leave a word out.

00:02:29.873 --> 00:02:30.897
That's all.

00:02:30.974 --> 00:02:32.134
Understood.

00:02:38.482 --> 00:02:43.442
A Journey of a Thousand Miles
Begins with a Single Step

00:02:44.821 --> 00:02:46.049
I must admit...

00:02:46.123 --> 00:02:49.217
...I'm surprised to see her work harder
than the men despite this heat.

00:02:49.593 --> 00:02:51.185
Last time, she was a consort.

00:02:51.261 --> 00:02:54.128
This time, she's dressed as a boy,
acting as a page.

00:02:54.197 --> 00:02:56.859
She's living quite the full life,
isn't she?

00:02:58.268 --> 00:03:01.760
But you really came up with
quite the idea.

00:03:01.838 --> 00:03:05.797
Not only did you stick her into the
short-staffed Department of Finance...

00:03:05.876 --> 00:03:09.607
...you specifically assigned her
as Secretary Kou's personal assistant.

00:03:10.614 --> 00:03:12.081
Huh?

00:03:12.149 --> 00:03:13.207
Fath...

00:03:14.051 --> 00:03:16.485
Lord Shoka.
I've come to return these.

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:19.712
Not to worry, Princess.
Right now, I'm the only one here.

00:03:20.257 --> 00:03:23.124
It seems that Ensei, who only came
to look out for Lady Shurei...

00:03:23.193 --> 00:03:25.491
...is being put to work as well.

00:03:25.562 --> 00:03:28.998
While he's as competent as they come,
he's as weird as they come, too.

00:03:29.066 --> 00:03:32.399
Everything about Secretary Kou
is shrouded in mystery.

00:03:33.603 --> 00:03:36.572
This year might end up being
the worst year of Lady Shurei's life...

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:38.505
...in terms of misfortune.

00:03:38.608 --> 00:03:42.271
But really, I'm always nervous that
someone's gonna find out I'm female.

00:03:42.346 --> 00:03:45.577
No worries, no worries!
Koyu said so himself, didn't he?

00:03:45.882 --> 00:03:47.110
There's no need to worry.

00:03:47.184 --> 00:03:50.415
With that figure of yours, there's no way
anyone will notice you're a woman.

00:03:50.487 --> 00:03:51.579
Right?

00:03:52.489 --> 00:03:55.390
But, Secretary Kou's very clever, so...!

00:03:55.459 --> 00:03:56.892
No worries, no worries.

00:03:56.960 --> 00:04:00.259
People will definitely only see you as
a boy, so have a little more confidence.

00:04:01.798 --> 00:04:03.766
What do you mean
by "confidence"?

00:04:05.936 --> 00:04:07.233
Uh, well...!

00:04:08.672 --> 00:04:11.800
Wow!
You're so feminine, Princess!

00:04:12.142 --> 00:04:14.610
And you're so good
at cooking!

00:04:14.878 --> 00:04:16.277
Hey, you!

00:04:16.346 --> 00:04:19.213
Once again, thank you very much,
General Ran and Koyu.

00:04:19.449 --> 00:04:21.781
For bringing us so much food.

00:04:21.852 --> 00:04:22.978
Don't mention it.

00:04:23.286 --> 00:04:25.777
You must enjoy cooking, given how
you serve such delicious cuisine.

00:04:25.856 --> 00:04:27.084
Hey, you!

00:04:27.157 --> 00:04:30.149
You're being lent out to help
with hunting bandits...

00:04:30.227 --> 00:04:32.320
...so make
sure you eat properly.

00:04:32.396 --> 00:04:34.364
- Y-Yes.
- By the way, Shurei.

00:04:34.364 --> 00:04:35.558
How's work?

00:04:35.632 --> 00:04:38.192
Great. Everyday is so much fun.

00:04:38.835 --> 00:04:40.803
It's fun, huh?

00:04:41.104 --> 00:04:45.871
Oh, Lord Koyu, please help me study
after dinner again, okay?

00:04:45.942 --> 00:04:46.966
Sure.

00:04:57.521 --> 00:04:59.890
All right.
We'll leave it at that for today.

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:01.323
Thank you very much.

00:05:01.391 --> 00:05:03.359
Now, for today's homework...!

00:05:11.835 --> 00:05:13.166
That idiot.

00:05:29.719 --> 00:05:30.686
Shu Hong.

00:05:30.754 --> 00:05:31.778
Yes?

00:05:34.925 --> 00:05:36.358
What can I do for you?

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:38.928
If there were a surplus
in the national budget...

00:05:38.995 --> 00:05:40.963
...what would you do
with the money?

00:05:42.032 --> 00:05:44.000
Yes. Well...

00:05:44.434 --> 00:05:48.803
I would probably establish financial aid
for midwives and pregnant women...

00:05:49.105 --> 00:05:52.563
...or financial assistance
for needy scholars.

00:05:53.009 --> 00:05:56.103
Oh, and some should be allocated
for research on...

00:05:56.179 --> 00:05:58.147
...improving grains to be
resistant to disasters.

00:05:59.149 --> 00:06:01.379
There are plenty of ways
to spend the budget.

00:06:02.052 --> 00:06:05.385
Even if you have money left over,
you can't feed people in a crisis...

00:06:05.655 --> 00:06:07.919
...so I think it should be spent
in ways that would be useful.

00:06:07.991 --> 00:06:09.288
I'm back.

00:06:09.359 --> 00:06:10.826
Ah, thank you.

00:06:10.894 --> 00:06:11.986
Hi, there.

00:06:12.062 --> 00:06:13.689
- Shu Hong.
- Ah, yes!

00:06:14.064 --> 00:06:17.090
Go to the Koro Temple with Ensei
and return these papers.

00:06:17.334 --> 00:06:18.392
Right away, sir.

00:06:24.207 --> 00:06:29.372
That child really works hard. And those
were pretty surprising comments.

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:35.076
It really is a waste that it's only
a one-month, temporary position.

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:38.551
Koro Temple

00:06:40.824 --> 00:06:43.884
Look at the shape Koro Temple is in.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:47.088
No wonder they're giving
such outrageous estimates.

00:06:47.497 --> 00:06:49.965
About the only head
that's working properly...

00:06:50.033 --> 00:06:52.467
...in this insane heat
is Secretary Kou's.

00:06:52.536 --> 00:06:55.334
Surely it's gotta be hot
wearing a mask like that?!

00:06:55.405 --> 00:06:59.865
Rumor has it that he never takes
that mask off in front of other people.

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:02.970
Come to think of it,
he wears different ones, doesn't he?

00:07:03.046 --> 00:07:06.880
Yeah, I wonder how many of those
weird looking masks he's got!

00:07:07.117 --> 00:07:09.210
I wonder why he wears a mask?

00:07:10.153 --> 00:07:12.986
Supposedly he got rejected
by a woman because of his looks.

00:07:13.056 --> 00:07:14.182
What?!

00:07:14.624 --> 00:07:16.455
Though it's just a rumor.

00:07:17.227 --> 00:07:21.163
Then that mask is to hide
a really hideous face.

00:07:21.898 --> 00:07:23.923
But people aren't about looks.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.968
Secretary Kou's not a bad person.

00:07:26.036 --> 00:07:27.628
And while he's pretty hard
on people...

00:07:27.704 --> 00:07:29.797
...he's very intelligent, rich,
and has high social standing.

00:07:29.873 --> 00:07:32.171
If you became his wife,
you'd be able to live in great comfort!

00:07:32.242 --> 00:07:34.210
That last one reflects
your true feelings, doesn't it?

00:07:34.277 --> 00:07:36.802
What are you talking about?
Money's important!

00:07:37.013 --> 00:07:41.677
You know, I'm glad Seiran
made me your guard.

00:07:41.751 --> 00:07:43.981
It's a lot of fun being
with you, Princess.

00:07:45.789 --> 00:07:48.724
I wonder if Seiran will be able to
come home safely today too.

00:07:48.792 --> 00:07:51.090
Well, knowing him,
he should be fine.

00:07:51.361 --> 00:07:52.919
You're right.

00:07:52.996 --> 00:07:56.488
But I'm glad Seiran has
a friend like you, Ensei.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:58.592
- What do you mean?
- Well...

00:07:58.668 --> 00:08:01.831
...Seiran has a habit of keeping
a certain distance from others, right?

00:08:02.138 --> 00:08:04.629
So I was thinking
it's really great that...

00:08:04.708 --> 00:08:07.176
...he has a friend he feels
comfortable being close to.

00:08:10.013 --> 00:08:11.981
You're a good kid, Princess.

00:08:21.358 --> 00:08:23.349
Shurei?! Is that you, Shurei?!

00:08:25.295 --> 00:08:28.196
That's strange. I thought I just
sensed Shurei's presence.

00:08:28.264 --> 00:08:30.892
But she can't be here.
It must be the heat.

00:08:35.505 --> 00:08:36.836
Wow.

00:08:36.906 --> 00:08:39.204
He's got an animal-like
sense of smell.

00:08:39.275 --> 00:08:41.903
Those look heavy.
Let me help you.

00:08:43.079 --> 00:08:45.639
You're taking them to
Secretary Kou, aren't you?

00:08:47.517 --> 00:08:49.417
I heard that
a really hardworking boy...

00:08:49.486 --> 00:08:51.545
...recently joined
the Department of Finance.

00:08:51.621 --> 00:08:54.283
- That's you, right? What's your name?
- I'm Shu Hong.

00:08:54.357 --> 00:08:58.691
Shu, is it? Secretary Kou is very strict
so it must be very difficult.

00:08:58.762 --> 00:09:01.697
That's true, but on the other hand
I find it a good challenge.

00:09:03.533 --> 00:09:05.023
You're a good kid.

00:09:05.101 --> 00:09:06.500
U-Um...!

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.798
By the way, Shu,
what do you think of me?

00:09:09.873 --> 00:09:11.431
What do I think of you?

00:09:11.508 --> 00:09:13.908
I don't mind if you
want to be direct with me.

00:09:15.311 --> 00:09:17.302
I think you're a nice person.

00:09:19.115 --> 00:09:20.275
Really?

00:09:22.852 --> 00:09:25.582
Thank you very much for
carrying the books for me.

00:09:25.655 --> 00:09:28.954
The Department of Finance is right
over there, so... um, what's your name?

00:09:29.025 --> 00:09:31.152
Oh, me? I'm...!

00:09:34.097 --> 00:09:37.294
Please... call me uncle.

00:09:38.101 --> 00:09:40.035
U-Uncle?

00:09:40.103 --> 00:09:42.230
That's right, uncle.

00:09:42.672 --> 00:09:44.731
Well then, do your best.

00:09:44.808 --> 00:09:46.742
Yes. Thank you very much.

00:09:53.183 --> 00:09:54.548
Uncle.

00:09:55.418 --> 00:09:57.386
Oh, music to my ears.

00:09:58.021 --> 00:09:59.147
Well, then.

00:09:59.222 --> 00:10:01.554
See you later! Shu!

00:10:02.459 --> 00:10:05.690
I wonder if there's an increase
in weird people because of this heat.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.161
Hello, I'm back!

00:10:09.899 --> 00:10:10.866
Huh?

00:10:20.176 --> 00:10:23.077
Secretary Kou must be exhausted.

00:10:29.919 --> 00:10:31.614
What beautiful hair.

00:10:36.059 --> 00:10:38.653
Wow! It's so silky!

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:48.831
C-Could this be...?

00:10:55.645 --> 00:10:57.280
What are you doing?

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:58.747
Ah... um...!

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.458
What's wrong, Shu Hong?!

00:11:08.458 --> 00:11:10.221
Seiran!

00:11:16.633 --> 00:11:17.964
My Lady!

00:11:18.034 --> 00:11:19.831
What're you doing
just standing there?!

00:11:19.903 --> 00:11:22.167
- We'll go back to the base for now.
- Y-Yes, sir!

00:11:26.242 --> 00:11:27.368
My Lady!

00:11:29.045 --> 00:11:34.005
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:38.721 --> 00:11:40.382
H-Hey, what's wrong?!

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:42.457
Calm down, Shu Hong!

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:45.057
H-Hey!

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:12.650
I-I'm so sorry!

00:12:15.458 --> 00:12:18.621
I got to see something really
interesting today!

00:12:18.695 --> 00:12:20.822
It's no laughing matter.

00:12:20.897 --> 00:12:24.230
I was worried because
you hate thunder so much.

00:12:24.701 --> 00:12:27.636
But, I'm glad you weren't
by yourself.

00:12:27.904 --> 00:12:31.931
This is awful! No doubt, Secretary Kou's
thoroughly disgusted with me.

00:12:32.108 --> 00:12:34.906
- But it really is good.
- There's nothing good about it!

00:12:34.978 --> 00:12:38.778
But, you always get sad
at this time of year, right?

00:12:39.916 --> 00:12:41.406
Working in the Outer Courts...

00:12:41.484 --> 00:12:43.975
...has been a good change of scenery
for you, hasn't it?

00:12:46.122 --> 00:12:48.682
But it's only for a month.

00:12:49.392 --> 00:12:50.757
Shurei!

00:12:50.827 --> 00:12:54.126
It's okay. I'm really satisfied
even if it is for only a month.

00:13:04.707 --> 00:13:07.540
Here. I've brought a snack
for the hard working Princess.

00:13:08.111 --> 00:13:09.305
Thank you.

00:13:11.814 --> 00:13:13.213
There was a time in the past...

00:13:13.283 --> 00:13:15.911
...when I thought about
taking the regional exams.

00:13:17.387 --> 00:13:19.821
You wanted to become
a provincial official?

00:13:19.889 --> 00:13:21.117
Well yeah.

00:13:21.758 --> 00:13:22.725
And?

00:13:23.192 --> 00:13:27.390
Well... a number of things came up.
So in the end... you know.

00:13:29.732 --> 00:13:31.825
You could take it next time.

00:13:31.901 --> 00:13:36.531
Maybe I will. And if I do,
I can study with you.

00:13:36.606 --> 00:13:39.040
Lord Koyu's incredibly strict.

00:13:39.108 --> 00:13:41.201
Ah, well I'll pass on that.

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:45.447
Hey, Ensei.

00:13:46.249 --> 00:13:49.707
Do you think it's foolish to keep
chasing after an impossible dream?

00:13:50.586 --> 00:13:53.851
Your dream is to become
a court official, isn't it?

00:13:55.158 --> 00:13:57.649
- You knew.
- Well yeah.

00:13:57.727 --> 00:14:00.753
You're working hard like this
until it's late every night.

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:03.863
And you seem to be really enjoying
the work in the Outer Courts.

00:14:04.968 --> 00:14:09.200
But, regardless of how hard I try,
women can't take the National Exams.

00:14:09.272 --> 00:14:10.967
And yet you still
study hard like this...

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:12.974
...even though you're aware
of that fact, right?

00:14:13.042 --> 00:14:15.374
I guess. Because we're free
to chase after...

00:14:15.445 --> 00:14:17.345
...whatever dreams
we desire, right?

00:14:17.413 --> 00:14:20.280
You know, lately, it seems to be
closer than ever.

00:14:21.017 --> 00:14:22.314
Closer?

00:14:22.385 --> 00:14:25.081
My dream and reality
are so close right now.

00:14:25.555 --> 00:14:27.580
Working in the Department
of Finance every day...

00:14:27.657 --> 00:14:30.091
...the border of my dream
is within reach.

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:32.892
Like I could grasp it in my hands.

00:14:35.231 --> 00:14:38.132
I never knew
that becoming an adult...

00:14:38.201 --> 00:14:41.227
...makes it so much harder
to keep chasing your dreams.

00:14:42.105 --> 00:14:45.165
Even so, you still haven't given up,
have you, Princess?

00:14:50.279 --> 00:14:53.112
Well, no. I want to try and
do as much as I can.

00:14:54.951 --> 00:14:56.509
That's the Princess I know!

00:14:56.586 --> 00:14:59.384
As they say, a journey of a thousand
miles begins with a single step.

00:14:59.455 --> 00:15:01.855
Even though each step is small,
you never know...

00:15:01.924 --> 00:15:04.324
...if you'll end up achieving
a major goal.

00:15:04.394 --> 00:15:05.986
Especially you, Princess.

00:15:10.199 --> 00:15:13.225
Thank you. Thanks to you,
I'm feeling much better now.

00:15:13.302 --> 00:15:15.463
You're like fresh air, aren't you, Ensei?

00:15:15.805 --> 00:15:19.605
Now I can sort of understand why
Father and Seiran sent you here.

00:15:21.778 --> 00:15:24.008
Aw, so you could tell?

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.048
From how the rice balls
are shaped.

00:15:26.449 --> 00:15:28.508
Father's are poorly formed...

00:15:28.584 --> 00:15:32.111
...while Seiran's are the large,
round ones that are light on salt, right?

00:15:32.622 --> 00:15:35.318
After all,
I said something odd at dinner.

00:15:36.893 --> 00:15:40.420
Wow. You're really sharp, Princess.

00:15:42.765 --> 00:15:46.326
I think you'd really be suited
to become a court official.

00:15:46.402 --> 00:15:48.563
So I really hope you
won't give up.

00:15:53.209 --> 00:15:55.336
Now then, back to work!

00:16:03.319 --> 00:16:06.652
Are you still working?
Talk about tenacious.

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:10.618
It's lonely not being able
to see Shurei...

00:16:10.693 --> 00:16:13.457
...but I wanna get this bill passed
as quickly as possible.

00:16:13.529 --> 00:16:16.191
In a certain sense,
you could say it's selfishly motivated.

00:16:16.265 --> 00:16:17.926
What are you talking about?!

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:20.195
This world is made up
of men and women.

00:16:20.269 --> 00:16:23.602
The idea that politics is only
for men is outdated.

00:16:23.673 --> 00:16:26.164
Opening the gates to allow women
to become court officials...

00:16:26.242 --> 00:16:28.437
...will be good for the country.

00:16:32.748 --> 00:16:34.010
Your Majesty!

00:16:36.419 --> 00:16:38.319
Please wait, Shurei.

00:16:39.956 --> 00:16:41.446
Uncle.

00:16:44.026 --> 00:16:46.551
Uncle. I love the sound of that.

00:16:47.063 --> 00:16:48.655
Are you the one responsible...

00:16:48.731 --> 00:16:50.995
...for sending that woman to me,
Reishin Hong?

00:16:51.067 --> 00:16:54.434
No. You'd have to talk to Koyu
about that one.

00:16:54.504 --> 00:16:57.166
No doubt he thought having
you see firsthand how she worked...

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:59.231
...would be the quickest way.

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:03.411
You knew she's a woman
yet you still hired her, didn't you?

00:17:03.479 --> 00:17:05.538
We were just short on people.

00:17:06.015 --> 00:17:09.109
For starters, introducing a bill
for women to take the National Exams...

00:17:09.185 --> 00:17:11.119
...is an utterly impossible,
foolish idea.

00:17:11.187 --> 00:17:14.054
Because His Majesty said it would
start with the next exam, right?

00:17:14.624 --> 00:17:17.058
That's why you killed it
without a word.

00:17:17.326 --> 00:17:18.918
There's not enough time.

00:17:18.995 --> 00:17:21.293
Not only will it take time to
change the preconception...

00:17:21.364 --> 00:17:23.195
...that politics is only for men...

00:17:23.266 --> 00:17:28.033
...but we'll also need to set up a lot of
programs for women to take the exams.

00:17:29.805 --> 00:17:34.037
I have one question. Why did you,
the clever, cool-headed, cold-blooded...

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:38.376
...heartless, pitiless, icy head of the
Department of Civil Affairs not oppose it?

00:17:38.447 --> 00:17:42.747
What a foolish question. Just what have
you been seeing in that child every day?

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:47.447
Are you suggesting she's possibly
at a level to pass the National Exams?

00:17:47.523 --> 00:17:52.392
Of course. And in the top ranks, too.
Koyu guarantees it.

00:17:54.530 --> 00:17:58.398
If you overlook the fact that he's your
adopted child, Assistant Secretary Ri...

00:17:58.467 --> 00:18:01.436
...is a wonderfully talented person
to bear the burden of this era.

00:18:01.504 --> 00:18:04.769
And if you ignore the fact that
Shu Hong's your niece...

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:06.865
...she's actually quite superb.

00:18:06.943 --> 00:18:10.538
Taking that girl as my wife
might not be a bad idea.

00:18:10.613 --> 00:18:13.207
What?! I absolutely won't allow that!

00:18:13.783 --> 00:18:16.047
You can't even tell her
you're her real uncle...

00:18:16.118 --> 00:18:18.177
...so what right do you have
to oppose it?

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:22.649
This is my latest! Take it!

00:18:26.696 --> 00:18:29.790
I have to admit, this latest one
I made is simply a masterpiece.

00:18:29.865 --> 00:18:32.800
I call it the "a little done in
by the summer heat" look.

00:18:33.169 --> 00:18:35.865
If you wear this,
no doubt the people around you...

00:18:35.938 --> 00:18:38.372
...will feel more sympathetic and realize
that even Secretary Kou...

00:18:38.441 --> 00:18:40.841
...must be having a hard time
with the summer heat.

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:42.935
I don't want it! Take it with you!

00:18:49.185 --> 00:18:53.019
Um, would you like to take
a short break?

00:18:55.524 --> 00:18:58.584
Even if it's only once a day for tea.

00:19:01.597 --> 00:19:02.564
Yeah.

00:19:24.954 --> 00:19:29.015
For him to drink tea so readily...
It's very unusual.

00:19:29.091 --> 00:19:30.558
Really?

00:19:30.626 --> 00:19:33.186
He must've really taken to you.

00:19:34.563 --> 00:19:36.531
- Me?
- Yes.

00:19:37.033 --> 00:19:39.797
By the way, Shu, have you ever
taken the National Exams?

00:19:41.003 --> 00:19:42.732
- No.
- Huh?

00:19:42.805 --> 00:19:45.330
I was sure you would have
tried it at least once.

00:19:45.408 --> 00:19:48.241
In that case,
please try taking the next exam.

00:19:48.311 --> 00:19:50.745
And then formally join
the Department of Finance.

00:19:50.813 --> 00:19:54.078
Um, I'm really happy you say so...

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:57.313
...but actually,
I can't take the National Exams.

00:19:58.487 --> 00:19:59.886
You can't take them?

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:03.818
Yuri. Tengai Kou and
Sonshi Heki have collapsed.

00:20:04.994 --> 00:20:06.985
Even those two.

00:20:07.063 --> 00:20:09.725
Summer will be over soon. If we can
get through the next little while...

00:20:09.799 --> 00:20:13.826
...we'll be okay.
- Um, we'll do our best. Right, Ensei?

00:20:14.804 --> 00:20:18.570
Ah, sure. Well, if it's something
we can handle, yeah.

00:20:19.041 --> 00:20:21.236
I see. In that case,
Ensei, as of now...

00:20:21.310 --> 00:20:24.507
...you're a temporary administrative
official of the Department of Finance.

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:26.980
You'll be responsible for the work
of the two that just collapsed.

00:20:27.049 --> 00:20:29.347
I'll write a letter of authority later.

00:20:29.418 --> 00:20:32.717
You can do this,
can't you, Ensei Ro?

00:20:42.098 --> 00:20:46.057
Why? Why can't I get to
His Majesty's rooms?

00:20:46.502 --> 00:20:51.030
I've gone there a number of times!
It can't be possible for me to get lost.

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:52.937
Assistant Secretary Ri.

00:20:53.676 --> 00:20:55.644
Hello, Assistant Secretary Kei.

00:20:55.878 --> 00:20:58.779
Actually, I wanted to discuss
something with you about Shu.

00:20:58.848 --> 00:21:01.146
Could it be that
they've figured out she's a girl?

00:21:01.217 --> 00:21:03.082
Has he caused a problem?

00:21:03.152 --> 00:21:06.144
Not at all. He really works hard.

00:21:06.222 --> 00:21:09.157
Secretary Kou seems to have
taken to him as well.

00:21:09.225 --> 00:21:11.455
Oh? Secretary Kou has?

00:21:11.527 --> 00:21:14.496
I think that he'd make
a good official.

00:21:14.897 --> 00:21:18.890
But when I asked, he said that
he can't take the National Exams.

00:21:19.935 --> 00:21:22.403
So, if there's some reason for that...

00:21:22.471 --> 00:21:25.838
...I thought, I wouldn't mind
becoming Shu's sponsor.

00:21:27.810 --> 00:21:29.300
Assistant Secretary Kei...

00:21:29.378 --> 00:21:32.643
...Shu would be very happy
to hear those words from you.

00:21:33.315 --> 00:21:36.148
However, he can't accept your offer.

00:21:36.352 --> 00:21:38.877
I believe you'll understand
the reason later.

00:21:38.954 --> 00:21:41.047
When he becomes an official.

00:21:41.123 --> 00:21:43.182
Then, Shu will take
the National Exams?

00:21:43.259 --> 00:21:45.750
When the time comes, I think either
I or my superior will take care...

00:21:45.828 --> 00:21:48.729
...of the sponsorship issue.
- That's wonderful.

00:21:50.399 --> 00:21:52.424
- By the way, Assistant Secretary Kei.
- Yes?

00:21:52.501 --> 00:21:54.833
Where are you
on your way to now?

00:21:54.904 --> 00:21:58.533
Well, I'm to deliver
a rush letter to His Majesty.

00:21:59.041 --> 00:22:01.373
Oh, what a coincidence.

00:22:02.311 --> 00:22:05.280
Actually, so am I. Let's go together.

00:22:11.287 --> 00:22:13.687
Hunting bandits
again tonight, Ensei?

00:22:16.459 --> 00:22:18.689
- You noticed?
- Yeah.

00:22:18.761 --> 00:22:21.628
Not to mention each and every
bandit we've captured...

00:22:21.697 --> 00:22:23.756
...said that they were searching
for a man...

00:22:23.833 --> 00:22:27.132
...with a cross-shaped scar
on his left cheek.

00:22:27.736 --> 00:22:29.203
Oh boy.

00:22:29.271 --> 00:22:30.932
While I don't know why...

00:22:31.006 --> 00:22:33.372
...just don't cause any trouble
for the master or her ladyship.

00:22:35.177 --> 00:22:37.008
- What?
- Nothing.

00:22:37.079 --> 00:22:41.038
I was just thinking how you were
taken in to a really good place.

00:22:43.719 --> 00:22:46.210
Princess really works hard
every night, doesn't she?

00:22:46.288 --> 00:22:47.721
Yeah.

00:22:47.790 --> 00:22:50.315
The two of you should get married.

00:22:50.392 --> 00:22:52.622
- Just what are you saying?!
- That way...

00:22:52.695 --> 00:22:54.629
...everything would fall
neatly into place.

00:22:54.697 --> 00:22:56.665
She'd be able to keep studying...

00:22:56.732 --> 00:22:59.826
...and people around her would stop
saying she should get married soon.

00:23:00.236 --> 00:23:02.704
Not to mention, given your
rotten personality...

00:23:02.771 --> 00:23:06.400
...there aren't too many women you
wanna spend your life with, are there?

00:23:07.243 --> 00:23:10.144
I'll inform General Haku
that you've been...

00:23:10.212 --> 00:23:12.339
...hunting bandits from
Sa Province every night.

00:23:12.414 --> 00:23:14.678
Sorry! I won't say another word! Later!

00:23:18.020 --> 00:23:19.009
Darn.

00:23:20.756 --> 00:23:23.919
"A journey of a thousand miles
begins with a single step."

00:23:30.566 --> 00:23:35.663
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:35.804 --> 00:23:42.368
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.478 --> 00:23:47.541
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.644
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.722 --> 00:23:58.182
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.728 --> 00:24:04.859
You are just like me

00:24:05.601 --> 00:24:10.129
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.205 --> 00:24:16.110
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.079 --> 00:24:22.881
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:22.985 --> 00:24:27.854
I will always think of you

00:24:28.991 --> 00:24:41.665
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.074 --> 00:24:45.574
Next Episode

00:24:45.574 --> 00:24:47.910
Next Episode
Just who is Ensei, anyway?

00:24:47.910 --> 00:24:47.943
Next Episode

00:24:47.943 --> 00:24:51.614
Next Episode
Good Things Come to Those Who Wait
He's got an overgrown beard, and is
quite uncouth, but he's a good worker.

00:24:51.614 --> 00:24:51.647
Next Episode
Good Things Come to Those Who Wait

00:24:51.647 --> 00:24:54.350
Next Episode
Good Things Come to Those Who Wait
And he seems to be a good fighter.
And he's being hunted by bandits.

00:24:54.350 --> 00:24:55.112
And he seems to be a good fighter.
And he's being hunted by bandits.

00:24:55.851 --> 00:24:56.818
What?!
